# src/

Core gRPC server implementation for Udex, providing service handlers for entry and index operations, authentication/authorization middleware, and configuration management. This directory contains the main server logic, including service implementations, request interceptors, and initialization code.

## Files

- `lib.rs` -- Library root; exports public APIs, defines `Error` type and `HealthCheck` trait
- `server.rs` -- Server startup and initialization; bootstraps datastore, applies migrations, wires services and middleware, starts Tonic server
- `authz.rs` -- JWT validation interceptor; handles JWKS/static key loading, token parsing, and claim extraction for authorization
- `config.rs` -- Configuration structures for server, TLS, and authentication; holds validated settings read at startup
- `entry.rs` -- Entry service implementation; handles CRUD operations, bulk operations, context hashing, and service initialization
- `index.rs` -- Index service implementation; manages index lifecycle (create, update, delete, list) with name validation and datastore persistence
- `healthz.rs` -- Health check service; aggregates health status from entry and index services, returns composite health response
- `logging.rs` -- Tracing initialization; sets up JSON output for production and human-readable output for tests, respects `RUST_LOG` env var
